# Python Project 2

- This is a simple calculator application created using Python and Tkinter.

- This calculator supports addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. 
- It also includes a clear button, basic error handling, and an easy-to-use button-based interface.

- The user enters numbers and operators using the buttons on the interface.
- When the equals button is pressed, the program calculates the result and displays it on the screen, or shows an error if the input is invalid.
